<title>UK: Emirates launch flights to Kuala Lumpur and Sanaa.</title>
<headline>Emirates launch flights to Kuala Lumpur and Sanaa.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dubai government-owned Emirates airline said it will be launching new services to Kuala Lumpur, and Sanaa on October 27 and 28 respectively.</p>
<p>Flights to Kuala Lumpur will operate thrice-weekly and to Sanaa twice-weekly, it said in a statement released here. -- Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax+44 171 542 5017</p>
</text>
